{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,subprocess\np=dict(action='review',artifact_id='b66ea551c3df493da3d4324ea0d5a8ff',rationale='Assess the paired public observations against the copy contract, preserving the distinction between export and live policy.',review_items=[dict(aspect='checker_correspondence',status='no_issue_found',source_ids=['s-config-clone','s-status-copy','s-status-api','s-autoleave-owner','s-node-contract','s-ready-contract','s-bootstrap','s-config','s-changer','s-raw-ready','s-clone-changer'],rationale='Executed artifact b66ea551c3df493da3d4324ea0d5a8ff matches the inspected fixed source. CheckRun 3fc0cc339fff420ab9534bb00d46b6ae completed with nine uniquely correlated pairs and no parse loss or missing results. Its implicit-joint entry at index 5 returns AutoLeave=true from ApplyConfChange on each of nodes 1,2,3; the immediately following Status.Config returns false for all three. Live diagnostic remains true and membership maps compare equal. Explicit-joint entry 5 and later implicit exit entry 6 each return false in both outputs. The requirement comes from Config.Clone promising a copy and getStatus describing the current peer state, with no documented scalar omission; the comparison does not derive its expectation from the suspect clone. ApplyConfChange returns switchToConfig/ConfState from the live tracker before the Status call, and no intervening mutation occurs. Initialization uses actual Bootstrap, persistence, ordered application, campaign and message-driven replication. Only entries actually returned in CommittedEntries are applied, and each batch is advanced afterward. Transfer/loss hooks retained in the helper are disabled: overlap, armed and dropping remain false. Thus the current history exercises a legal configuration observation and does not inherit the earlier transfer failure. There is no forced quorum state, fabricated acknowledgment or directly written private protocol state. MemoryStorage is the explicitly crash-free persistence substitute; public API access does not itself prove durability but the fixed Ready ordering does discharge this schedule\\\\'s caller duty. Identity case/node/index joins each installed prerequisite to its independent result; AutoLeave is the compared value, not a matching filter. Every result is emitted regardless of equality. The implicit witnesses establish the accepted scoped export defect; explicit and final-exit observations are diagnostic controls, not an expansion to an unrelated requirement. The alternative of live policy corruption is excluded in this history by the live diagnostic and successful normal automatic exit. Source call-site review likewise shows EnterJoint overwrites the cloned AutoLeave value, LeaveJoint intentionally clears it, and Simple refuses joint input. These mechanisms do not repair Status but limit the finding to copied introspection. No memory-independence property beyond scalar preservation is inferred.',limitations=['Observed consequence is incorrect Status.Config.AutoLeave; no external consumer behavior, persisted recovery corruption or consensus safety failure is demonstrated.','Controls with false AutoLeave corroborate scalar defaulting but do not prove correctness of all configuration fields or clone aliasing.'],report_title='Status 配置副本遗漏 AutoLeave',report_answer='三个节点实际应用隐式联合配置后，ApplyConfChange 返回 AutoLeave=true，但紧接着的 Status.Config 返回 false。实时配置仍为 true，正常退出也继续发生，因此证据支持状态导出错误，不支持实时共识状态损坏。')],feedback=dict(ref_ids=['b66ea551c3df493da3d4324ea0d5a8ff','3fc0cc339fff420ab9534bb00d46b6ae','B-config-copy','s-config-clone','s-clone-changer'],answered='Actual public paired observations confirm false AutoLeave in Status.Config for each of three installed implicit-joint configurations while ApplyConfChange and live state show true. All nine pairs completed and the three implicit-entry pairs violated the equality oracle. The normal automatic exit still occurred.',remaining=['External use of incorrect status remains unobserved and outside this obligation.','Deferred-read release after configuration-driven commitment remains a separate unresolved surface.'],understanding='updated',rationale='The copy discrepancy is measured independently of the earlier liveness finding and has its own scoped interface requirement.'))\njson.dump(p,open('submission.json','w'),indent=2)\nr=json.load(open('../research.json'));x=subprocess.run(r['validation']['command']+['submission.json'],capture_output=True,text=True);print(x.stdout,x.stderr)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
